          "similarity_score": 0.30501443,
          "dense_rank": 9,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n## If the clinic is running late\n\nSometimes an earlier appointment takes longer than planned. If your practitioner is running more than 20 minutes behind, the front desk will tell you w",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 22,
